<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBP-QA-Y6-005>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBP-QA-Y6-005" ;
  triage:title "TestRuntime Mutex fields lack rationale comment — RBP-006" ;
  triage:description "TestRuntime at send/mod.rs:1033 holds appended_messages: Mutex<Vec<MessageEnvelope>> and hook_captures: Mutex<Vec<HookCapture>> without a code comment explaining the cross-thread sharing requirement. The use of Mutex is correct (test double shared via Arc in concurrent send tests) but RBP-006 requires interior mutability to be accompanied by a rationale comment. Fix: add a brief comment on TestRuntime: '// Mutex required: TestRuntime is shared across threads in concurrent send tests'." ;
